msgstr "สำหรับตัวอย่างแรก ลองดู circuit 10 qubit ต่อไปนี้:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It can sometimes be convenient to convert away from the bytes format in the "
"`BitArray` to bitstrings. The `get_count` method returns a dictionary "
